  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Citizens - Green Transition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to promote green transition through empowering the role of citizens, schools, communities and businesses. The project aims to equip, engage and promote citizens, schools, communities and businesses with knowledge and tools to participate effectively in Vietnam&#x2019;s green transition. Citizens and organizations will receive networking and technical supports to participate in climate and environment programs, piloting and replicating their initiatives from green schools to communities and businesses.</narrative>
  </description>
